<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Mahinda V</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">r. <a href="/years/982">982</a>–1017</span> · <a href="/centuries/10th-century">10th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Mahinda V was the last king of the Anuradhapura Kingdom in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sri-lanka">Sri Lanka</a>, reigning from 982. His rule was weakened by unpaid <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mercenary">mercenaries</a> and revolt, and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/chola-empire">Chola Empire</a> under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rajaraja-i">Rajaraja I</a> took <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/anuradhapura">Anuradhapura</a> in 993. In 1017 Rajendra I captured him, and he died a prisoner in the Chola country in 1029.</p></div>
